  "mach:judgement": "Assess",
  "mach:judgementReason": "The most comprehensive open evaluation framework for medical LLMs — 121 clinician-validated tasks across 5 clinical domains, published in Nature Medicine 2025. Built on the established HELM framework with Apache 2.0 licence. The repo is very new and community traction is still low. Assess now; expect to move to Adopt once star count and downstream adoption confirm real-world uptake beyond the paper.",
